        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "出爲竟陵王征北長史，加輔國將軍，尋徙爲冠軍長史、江夏內史，將軍如故。",
        "reading": "竟陵王征北長史、輔國將軍，後冠軍長史、江夏內史。",
        "note": "竟陵王征北長史、輔國將軍，後冠軍長史、江夏內史。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p004",
        "start_codepoint": 106,
        "end_codepoint": 140,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:received_sentence5-0",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "永明元年，爲吏部尚書。",
        "reading": "齊永明元年483任吏部尚書。",
        "note": "齊永明元年483任吏部尚書。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 0,
        "end_codepoint": 11,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:received_sentence5-11",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "炫居身清立，非弔問不雜交遊，論者以爲美。",
        "reading": "品行清立，弔問之外少交遊。",
        "note": "品行清立，弔問之外少交遊。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 11,
        "end_codepoint": 31,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:received_sentence5-31",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "及在選部，門庭蕭索，賔客罕至。",
        "reading": "居選部而少賓客。",
        "note": "居選部而少賓客。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 31,
        "end_codepoint": 46,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:received_sentence5-46",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "出行，左右捧黃紙帽箱，風吹紙剝僅盡。",
        "reading": "帽箱紙剝作清儉例。",
        "note": "帽箱紙剝作清儉例。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 46,
        "end_codepoint": 64,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:received_sentence5-64",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "fxb_jh0_jba",
        "source_quote": "罷江夏還，得錢十七万，於石頭并分與親族，病無以市藥。",
        "reading": "罷江夏得十七万，分給親族，病無錢買藥。",
        "note": "罷江夏得十七万，分給親族，病無錢買藥。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-032-chuxuan:p005",
        "start_codepoint": 64,
        "end_codepoint": 90,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
